    "feature_toggles": "The entire gamification system can be globally enabled or disabled using the `Xikolo.config.gamification['enabled']` flag. Furthermore, individual gamification rules can be effectively deactivated by setting their awarded points to zero or by commenting them out in the configuration, though the latter approach requires careful consideration of potential side effects on dependent rules or badge calculations."
  },
  "open_badges_integration": {
    "description": "The system includes configuration for Open Badges, specifically `open_badges` settings within `badge_config.yml` fixtures. This configuration contains public and private RSA keys, indicating the capability to issue verifiable digital badges compliant with the Open Badges standard. While the direct issuance implementation is not detailed, this feature signifies a broader potential for external recognition of user achievements."
  },
